Content: From GIS to Construction Drawings: What Good Design Process Looks Like | Rayco, Inc. Skip to content (469) 215-4550 Rayco, Inc. Home About Services Contact Careers Blog rayco-digs.com From GIS to Construction Drawings: What Good Design Process Looks Like Published May 2026 The gap between good and great in fiber design often comes down to one thing: how well you manage the transition from raw GIS data to finished construction drawings. At Rayco, we've seen what happens when that process breaks down — and what it looks like when it runs right. The Challenge: GIS Data Is Rarely Clean The first thing